2 CONC n of Joseph/Josef Muc and Katarina Tezak. He was born on 25 Jul 1860 in Gornja Lukovica 8, Metlika Parish, Republic of Slovenia. He died on 19 May 1918 in Jamestown, Stutsman County, North Dakota, USA.
