2 CONT
2 CONT According to Lavik ættebok, Synneve's parents should be [https://www.geni.com/people/Ole-Aven/6000000008996953734 Ole Hansson Aven] and [https://www.geni.com/people/Ingeborg-Avedal/6000000011264176357 Ingeborg Johannesdotter Aveda
2 CONC l]. '''This is not correct.''' From the christening, we see that her father is Ole ''Olsson'' Aven. (The christening date is the same as in the census of 1815). From the census of 1801, we see that the parents are actually Ole Ols
2 CONC son Aven and Guri Lassesdatter.
