1 NAME Lars Olsson /Eseim/
2 GIVN Lars Olsson
2 SURN Eseim
2 _MARNM Eknesvåg
1 NAME Lars //
2 GIVN Lars
2 SURN
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 ADDR
3 STAE Hordaland
3 CTRY Norge
1 BIRT
2 DATE AUG 1804
