1 NAME Martin /Mutz/
2 GIVN Martin
2 _MARNM Mutz
1 NAME Martin Mutz
1 NAME /Muc/
2 GIVN
2 SURN Muc
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Calvary Cemetery
